# Cesium ion public browser token for the Mars 3D Tiles asset (asset 3644333).
# Create an app-specific token with assets:read only, restrict it to the
# Mars asset and SOLARA's exact app origins, then keep it in a local .env file.
# Vite embeds this public value at build time. Set it in the frontend build
# environment for hosted deployments; changing it requires a new build.
# Browser tokens are visible to users; never put private token scopes here.
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=
